## Sleep delta — slow 3 Hz delta binaural over a brown-noise bed
##
## 100 Hz carrier, 3 Hz beat (delta). Brown bed sits lower and darker
## than pink; use a low playback volume and a sleep timer.
##
## Headphones required (comfortable flat ones, not on-ear clamps).
## Render:
##   entrain render sleep-delta.sbg -f flac -b 24

all-off: -

sleep-delta: brown/25 100+3/30

0:00:00 sleep-delta
1:00:00 all-off
